I have only used suse to test the rapparmor package, and then I used
the binaries from the official repositories, and those seemed to work
OK for me: https://github.com/jeroenooms/RAppArmor/blob/master/OpenSuse.txt

yast is OK, but if you want to start managing servers you need to use
a command line program. zypper is suse's primary command line
interface to the package manager.

